{"name":"Deco Red","hex":"#824942","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"deco","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Decompression."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A friendship book in which people add decorative elements such as drawings, stickers and sequins.","Clipping of decoration."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/deco"},{"term":"red","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The color of the setting sun, blood, and strawberries; the color which is evoked by the longest visible wavelengths (between about 625–740 nm), and a primary additive color.","A revolutionary socialist or (most commonly) a Communist;  a Bolshevik, a supporter of the Bolsheviks in the Russian Civil War."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a red hue.","Having an orange-brown or orange-blond colour; ginger."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/red"}],"entries":[{"title":"Deco","blocks":[{"text":"Anderson Luís de Souza, also known as Deco, is a former professional footballer who primarily played as an attacking or central midfielder. Born and raised in Brazil, he played for the Portugal national team. He currently works as sporting director for Barcelona. Deco is widely considered one of the best midfielders of his generation."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Deco_com_o_Fluminense_em_2013_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Deco_com_o_Fluminense_em_2013_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deco"},{"title":"Red","blocks":[{"text":"Red is the color at the long wavelength end of the visible spectrum of light, next to orange and opposite violet. It has a dominant wavelength of approximately 625–750 nanometers. It is a primary color in the RGB color model and a secondary color in the CMYK color model, and is the complementary color of cyan. Reds range from the brilliant yellow-tinged scarlet and vermillion to bluish-red crimson, and vary in shade from the pale red pink to the dark red burgundy."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Delicious_fresh_strawberries_%284735910403%29.jpg/330px-Delicious_fresh_strawberries_%284735910403%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Deco_21dec2006.jpg/330px-Deco_21dec2006.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Deco_21dec2006.jpg/330px-Deco_21dec2006.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Deco playing for Barcelona in the 2006–07 season","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADeco_21dec2006.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Deco_%28Chelsea%2C_2008%29.jpg/330px-Deco_%28Chelsea%2C_2008%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Deco_%28Chelsea%2C_2008%29.jpg/330px-Deco_%28Chelsea%2C_2008%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Deco taking a penalty kick for Chelsea in 2008","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADeco_(Chelsea%2C_2008).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Portugal_2-3_Denmark%2C_Deco.jpg/500px-Portugal_2-3_Denmark%2C_Deco.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Portugal_2-3_Denmark%2C_Deco.jpg/500px-Portugal_2-3_Denmark%2C_Deco.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Deco playing for Portugal against Denmark in 2008","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APortugal_2-3_Denmark%2C_Deco.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.o